#Задача_add_public_site_theme_and_locale<[
Базис:
  AN-64 update: public site v1 must support light/dark theme and Russian/English locale for human-facing pages.
Вектор:
  Add public site theme tokens and light/dark toggle with persisted choice.
  Add RU/EN locale catalog for nav, hero, CTA labels, product pages, docs index.
  Ensure markdown/agent-facing docs remain discoverable and language-stable.
Цель:
  Visitor can switch theme and language without losing content; both themes are readable and both locales cover P0 pages.
Проверки:
  Theme toggle supports light/dark and persists selected theme
  Locale switch supports ru/en for navigation, hero, product pages and docs index
  public-site tests cover theme and locale rendering
Анализ:
  Theme and locale are P0 because public site must be usable for Russian operator workflow and English external/agent-facing audience.
Решение:
  Вердикт: полезно
  Implement as data-driven locale catalog and CSS variables, not duplicate page trees.

